      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Aha! Just tested it out and this is the issue I was having for the past few days. I was visiting different servers with friends, and commands that spawned items would spawn a non-interactable version of the item instead. It wasn't effecting any of my friends.\nSwitching my home to the default VRchat home from my Udon test world and resetting the game made those worlds work as intended when I visited them!",
      "viewerReactions": null
